; Export the payload's public entry points by their plain, undecorated names.
;
; OverlayDetach is declared WINAPI (__stdcall). On x86 that decorates the
; exported name to _OverlayDetach@4, which the host's GetProcAddress("OverlayDetach")
; would fail to find. A module-definition file pins the undecorated name on both
; x86 and x64, so the injector's by-name lookup works regardless of bitness.
EXPORTS
    OverlayDetach
